B.EC=new A.f8("Our support team will help you with any technical difficulties you may face.",null)
B.afs=new A.f8("If your teacher has set up the class for you, click on it (4) and press register (5). The credits that the teacher is charging for that session will automatically get debited from your account and transferred to the teacher\u2019s account.",null)
B.ED=new A.f8("If you encounter any technical issues while using the CLUE platform, you can reach out to our support team for assistance.",null)
B.afw=new A.f8("You can also search for sessions created for you by clicking on the 'Session Created for You' (3) button",null)
B.afz=new A.f8("Ensure this registration is done well in advance of the session, to make planning and organizing easier for both you and your teacher. ",null)
B.afF=new A.f8("Open your Calendar home page on the portal and search for a session by clicking the Search button next to the calendar (1). Enter the details you wish to search in the search popup and then click search (2).",null)
B.afG=new A.f8("If you wish to request a particular session from a teacher, you have 3 options.\n\nOption 1: Send the teacher a message via the messaging section and ask them to create a session according to your specifications (session details, timing, date etc). \n\nOption 2: Message Clue Support with the details of the session you wish to create (teacher name, session type, details, timing etc) and CLUE Support will ensure the teacher creates the session. This would be the quicker option as teachers are often busy and may not check notifications daily. \n\nOption 3: Click on the \u201cRequest Session\u201d button on the top right of the calendar page and fill in the details of the session you wish to request. The teacher will verify and make changes if needed and create the session. You can register for it as per the points above.\n",null)
B.EE=new A.f8("You can contact us via email at clueadmin@myclue.org or call us at +91 7483082677. We will respond to your queries as soon as possible.",null)
